using LantanaGroup.Link.Nhsn.App.Bff.Application.Models.Reference;

namespace LantanaGroup.Link.Nhsn.App.Bff.Domain.EncounterCodes;

// Reference codes for the Encounter Mapping step's CPT/SNOMED lookup tab.
//
// Hardcoded deliberately, not fetched from Terminology: Terminology's ValueSet $expand has no
// filter/search support at all, and its content store is empty in every environment today (nobody
// has loaded a CPT/SNOMED value set into it) — a real integration (ITerminologyRawClient) was tried
// and always came back empty, breaking the screen. Revisit once Terminology actually has content
// and search capability. The onboarding POC's full CPT/SNOMED reference table
// (NHSN-Onboarding-POC/index.html, ENCOUNTER_PROCEDURE_CODES), copied verbatim so this matches the
// POC exactly rather than serving a smaller curated subset. Generated, not hand-maintained —
// regenerate from the POC if that list changes rather than editing this file directly. It is NOT a
// transcription of the official HL7 US Core Encounter Type value set the UI links to
// (https://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/STU6.1/ValueSet-us-core-encounter-type.html); a clinical/coding SME
// should review this list before an NHSN submission relies on it.
